OL,3,ACelebrity Traitors returning tonight
OL,4,Awith star-studded cast
OL,5,
OL,6,FTime to return to the castle! Celebrity
OL,7,FTraitors is back for series two - watch
OL,8,Flive and follow along from 20:00 BST
OL,10,FClaudia Winkleman will welcome 21 new
OL,11,Fcontestants as they battle it out to
OL,12,Fwin up to #100,000 for their chosen
OL,13,Fcharity - here's a reminder of how the
OL,14,Fgame works
OL,16,FGet involved: Who would you pick to be
OL,17,Fthis year's traitors? And take our quiz
OL,18,Fto find out what role you would play in
OL,19,Fthe castle
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/18
